  "describe": "Step 1 of 4: a white 3-4-5 right triangle with a, b and c labels, the title \"A right triangle\" and two lines of text under it, a dimmed Back with a play triangle beside it, and Next on the right. Next (tap at 312, 440) shows \"The square on a\" and a blue square growing under side a with 9 in it; the next adds a purple square left of side b with 16; the last a green square tilted on the hypotenuse with 25, the text ending \"So a² + b² = c²\", and Next becomes Start over, which goes back to step 1. Play (105, 440) advances every 3 s, its icon becomes two bars (Pause), and stops on step 4; a tap on Back or Next while playing stops playing. step 3 renders the full figure. Mono: no play button (no motion), outlined Back, dots as grey rings with a white (black) current one. A screen reader hears \"Step 1 of 4: A right triangle\", the text, Back (disabled), Play and Next.",
